DESCRIPTION:Flyering in the city centre\, in German and English. Meet at 15:00 at Odeonsplatz\, then out in groups of about two and possibly on from there\; the exact spot is posted in the group's WhatsApp chat. Flyers are provided\, bring warm clothes. Drinks afterwards for whoever wants. Newcomers very welcome\, even for just an hour.
